<!-- People › Skills & training (design-people §10, §1.2; impl-people P18): the skills matrix (Development/SkillsMatrix, the default,
    a .qvue matrix with its terminal twin SkillsMatrixTui out of the menu), Qualifications and (P19) Training, with TrainingDetail and
    TrainingCertificate out of the menu. Every People
    user opens the area through the root, and what each sees is what Mantle's DevelopmentServices admit: the matrix to development
    and HR readers of the employer and to a manager for their reports; qualifications to the person, development, HR, a manager
    and the other staff readers, each at their level (an identity document's or work permit's number the person's and HR's alone;
    a manager and other staff readers verified ones' validity only). A self-service employee without the launcher opens the area
    by its own grant (BOSS_PPL_DEVELOPMENT), for their own qualifications and training (the sessions of their employers, their own
    places, results and certificates, and the sessions they train); the matrix is denied to them (BOSS_PPL_SKILLS). P19 review:
    Assessment forms (Development/AssessmentForms over the survey builder's shared screens with People's Development mount of its
    registration, service/ironstone/shared/SurveyApps.js): the training assessments, built by the learning administrator
    (PEOPLE_DEVELOP_EDIT, which Mantle's training assessment purpose admits beside PEOPLE_CONFIGURE), opened to BOSS_PEOPLE_DEVELOP
    and the People administrator and denied to the root user group and self-service (BOSS_PPL_ASSESSMENT_FORMS). -->
<screen xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="http://moqui.org/xsd/xml-screen-3.xsd"
        default-menu-title="Skills &amp; training" default-menu-index="12" menu-image="sym_o_school" menu-image-type="icon">
    <subscreens default-item="SkillsMatrix">
        <!-- the matrix is development's, HR's and the managers' (BOSS_PPL_SKILLS) and, through the root's ALWAYS, ADMIN's and the
            People administrator's (which the default's check, made before the screens are entered, does not inherit): the area opens
            on Qualifications for every other People user and a self-service employee, so its menu entry opens for each user it is
            shown to -->
        <conditional-default condition="ec.user.userId &amp;&amp; !ec.user.isInGroup('ADMIN') &amp;&amp; !ec.user.isInGroup('BOSS_PEOPLE_ADMIN') &amp;&amp; !ec.artifactExecution.isPermitted('component://mr-boss/screen/People/Development/SkillsMatrix.xml', 'AT_XML_SCREEN', 'view')"
                item="Qualifications"/>
        <!-- SkillsMatrix (menu index 1), Qualifications (2) and Training (3) are files under Development/, with SkillsMatrixTui,
            TrainingDetail and TrainingCertificate out of the menu -->
        <!-- P19 review: AssessmentForms (4), the training assessment forms, is a file under Development/ -->
    </subscreens>
    <widgets>
        <subscreens-active/>
    </widgets>
</screen>
